#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:5 240bf8820d984497a4b62d3645380e33
#: 9bccb4880aa144dda42fc660ce40d48b c37cebc461c84b0d908316e4fe8797bc
#: cdb6aab1e77c46f9b077c2be02503601 eecb7868908648718f2a2ac17e889582
msgid "GPIOs"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:7 208a8540f3f8436384b8008331f7aa33
#: 99572981f0b148d780d9f8a72d24a75a 9e52b8bdaa384a8e949d7a7129030ec7
#: b9c7545bc6b147fb9effc1456d7ef415 dcb2f43a6ba947c5bf86f985dce028cd
msgid ""
"In order to use an output as a GPIO, the individual ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` "
"parameter is merely set to \"-1\". If set to \"0\", it remains a PWM output,"
" unassigned to a function, but will not output any PWM signal unless "
"commanded by scripting or a GCS."
msgstr ""
"要将输出用作 GPIO，只需将各 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 参数设置为「-1」。如果设置为「0」，它保持为 PWM "
"输出，未分配到任何功能，但除非由脚本或 GCS 命令，否则不会输出任何 PWM 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:9 99756fdc3c114053aa082b9e0cb56938
#: cc135e419905440f912fa7010ad599a4 cc8ceac6b5fa4851bcede32e8d20cce4
#: ccb7dceb1ea746d785e082eec3674469 eb5e82adf97549fead74b8f6132ea293
msgid ""
"If the servo function is being \"mirrored\" to a remote device, as in the "
"case of a DroneCAN or KDECAN ESC, then in order to change the autopilot "
"board's corresponding output pin to be a GPIO, but allow the "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to still be assigned to the remote device, the "
":ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` parameter can be used to assign the "
"board pin to be a GPIO without affecting the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` assignment "
"for the remote device."
msgstr ""
"如果舵机功能被「镜像」到远程设备（如 DroneCAN 或 KDECAN ESC），为了将飞控板的对应输出引脚更改为 GPIO，同时允许 "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 仍分配给远程设备，可以使用 :ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` "
"参数将飞控板引脚分配为 GPIO，而不影响远程设备的 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 分配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:12 4eecf5e4b8094d83880d388374f2325d
#: 67ed22c4a5c34f5b8361aee1a80f6762 7a947df7de7446c79969ab958fec1f71
#: 7d3c2f3cbfa1410086587bb3e0631abc a452315da556411a8d9c28760090b102
msgid ""
"GPIOs should only source or sink 8mA (20mA absolute maximum). They are "
"intended as logic-level IO and must not be used to directly drive relay "
"coils, motors, LED strings, etc. Directly connecting electromechanical or "
"high-current devices to GPIOs can permanently damage the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 只应提供或接收 8mA（绝对最大 20mA）电流。它们用于逻辑电平 IO，不得直接驱动继电器线圈、电机、LED "
"串等。将机电或高电流设备直接连接到 GPIO 可能会永久损坏飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:14 219d22ecbdba4571857551faad5cfcb4
#: 47fe9b89ed8a4dd6990598e21900c0ee 5d06eeda19c74299a881b0e81aeb173e
#: 70a55f7c9642421889d86187f0e011ee a8a758201755429dbb60b8c296887ca3
msgid ""
"General Purpose Input/Outputs (GPIOs) are used in ArduPilot for control of "
":ref:`relays<common-relay>`, actuators, LEDs, :ref:`camera triggers<common-"
"camera-shutter-with-servo>`, :ref:`Start Button<startstop-switch>` etc. Some"
" functions also use a GPIO pin as an input, like :ref:`common-rpm`. Some "
"autopilots provide dedicated GPIO pins (sometimes labeled \"CAPTURE\" pins)."
" In addition, GPIOs can be obtained by re-configuring the PWM outputs."
msgstr ""
"通用输入/输出（GPIO）在 ArduPilot 中用于控制 :ref:`继电器<common-"
"relay>`、执行器、LED、:ref:`相机触发器<common-camera-shutter-with-"
"servo>`、:ref:`启动按钮<startstop-switch>` 等。某些功能也使用 GPIO 引脚作为输入，如 :ref:`common-"
"rpm`。某些飞控提供专用 GPIO 引脚（有时标注为「CAPTURE」引脚）。此外，还可以通过重新配置 PWM 输出来获得 GPIO。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:17 1539569b0f6644af89365de9b9474bd8
#: 277a8511120a468881473d46b937ebf2 77760612c97d48c9875b5a754ea9be05
#: c0735764610a4e84bf8549744f260c8a e7c55e2c6bef4cc0bbe2dedf0f992658
msgid "Configuring GPIOS"
msgstr "配置 GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:18 29d27b9ab2f84b78a985d4a2bafaa0dc
#: 29d4f17e27b04f95922f4614a055bff5 64fe95958b2a489e92d934b3ca66d0a8
#: 69dfcd5b643447d1bb55996fd2f2c475 73c8c693a4c84d2b81119d41c2b77aac
msgid ""
"In order to set a PWM/SERVO/MOTOR output to be a GPIO function, the "
"individual ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` parameter is set to \"-1\"."
msgstr "要将 PWM/SERVO/MOTOR 输出设置为 GPIO 功能，只需将各 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 参数设置为「-1」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:20 00d800b9262e42e3b8b9b26f180fbeb1
#: 3a705fb586a54f24974744199fe1962f 689661628c804f6a984b6995aa141d2c
#: 9c95e04fb71845b09063f26a0970cffc c0095efe6e404066bb379fadb60ca55b
msgid ""
"for autopilots using IOMCUs, if a \"MAIN\" output is configured as a GPIO, "
"it can only function as an output (ie RELAY,etc.) not an input. \"AUX\" "
"outputs can function either as inputs or outputs when configures as a GPIO."
msgstr ""
"对于使用 IOMCU 的飞控，如果将「MAIN」输出配置为 GPIO，它只能用作输出（即继电器等），不能用作输入。「AUX」输出配置为 GPIO "
"时可用作输入或输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:22 13008ea0cadb4cdea0f00a46e0fa6178
#: 301878bcce394321a33446628e97419c 910d9a81ac7d4d50b9b2111954ba2f14
#: a1be7543bdb745d1896554dc2aab66e9 b2efdb76c0ba437db54f7d74af3779f7
msgid ""
"Every time the autopilot initializes, it sends a log message to the ground "
"control station, showing which outputs are PWM/Oneshot/or DShot."
msgstr "每次飞控初始化时，都会向地面站发送日志消息，显示哪些输出是 PWM/Oneshot/DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:28 2279a76ab31640718cf40a5dd01227f7
#: 3fa09778c5734f088747042538193210 82bed883a31e4127a491a1ba40cb6321
#: 859e9a5d37f04f469f8b972cff82f9ef c1bf3ec14def4b0181110cac05a69d62
msgid "GPIO \"PIN\" NUMBER"
msgstr "GPIO「引脚」编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:30 299dadf9bfec4213ad1201254e8d36c7
#: 7d8aa9c0e0d746c883b462ee85058155 84e44c830bf5484fb876a17f8887b35e
#: d4851f51f902471f8a4149ab7f32ac12 e2734ce0c71f46938efa078937d34cf9
msgid ""
"Some GPIO-based functions require that the GPIO \"pin number\" to be entered"
" into an associated parameter. This pin number is assigned in the "
"autopilot's hardware definition file. Usually, the first GPIO capable output"
" is assigned pin 50, the second 51, etc. So in the above case of the "
"Pixhawk, AUX OUT 6 is pin 55."
msgstr ""
"某些基于 GPIO 的功能要求将 GPIO「引脚编号」输入到相关参数中。此引脚编号在飞控的硬件定义文件中分配。通常，第一个 GPIO 输出分配引脚 "
"50，第二个 51，依此类推。因此，在上述 Pixhawk 的情况下，AUX OUT 6 是引脚 55。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:32 0e9f54fa22be43b59b357b5ffc601129
#: 2a3fc3f995b94cc597867e4a72ba8391 3853f26b92ac44cf97dbb6749461b6bd
#: 8e745f8332d54915a383b4394f5d0649 ebdc9816a7c4413ca816aef42608f428
msgid ""
"You can verify an output's GPIO pin number assignment easily. First, find "
"its hwdef.dat file `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__"
" and determine the GPIO pin number listed beside its output number, as shown"
" below:"
msgstr ""
"您可以轻松验证输出的 GPIO 引脚编号分配。首先，在\\ `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__"
" 找到其 hwdef.dat 文件，并确定其输出编号旁边列出的 GPIO 引脚编号，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:37 14f1d568464f40f59dcab8bd31d29182
#: 671352ce83254b5e8f2c67b165654904 769233c6f7b840fa8e15632c66b59c4f
#: a1f3f11ed31a4e18842e5ae7e3b458a9 ecb5f106464b4d879db14d8d5440795b
msgid ""
"IOMCU \"MAIN\" output 1 thru 8 are mapped to GPIO pin numbers 101 to 108, "
"respectively."
msgstr "IOMCU 的「MAIN」输出 1 至 8 分别映射到 GPIO 引脚编号 101 至 108。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gpios.rst:39 388e362e45704e879e0fc04e8abbbb1f
#: 7f2539d87a974ee8b3c3008ce5ad6263 8ba6507cc93d4118a27cc43fd6a1b8ff
#: c23e81cb0dcc4371b23822f044e8c04d e0e9f471201b4a86af6726e7af16210e
msgid ""
"Usually, changing any feature or function's GPIO pin assignment will require"
" a reboot for it to take effect."
msgstr "通常，更改任何功能的 GPIO 引脚分配需要重启才能生效。"
